    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "e65683ca-b200-3cee-a507-fa4dea41bf04",
                "word": "siesta",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "5ebebf93-598f-41dc-b5d5-e377d087cf3a",
                        "entry_id": "e65683ca-b200-3cee-a507-fa4dea41bf04",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "siestas"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b9f253e2-d157-3c41-95f8-ca6783db433c",
                        "entry_id": "e65683ca-b200-3cee-a507-fa4dea41bf04",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A nap, especially an afternoon one taken during the hottest part of the day in some cultures."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "16afe079-ef5a-46f0-8d6f-75ecd6e0c9a7",
                                "sense_id": "b9f253e2-d157-3c41-95f8-ca6783db433c",
                                "text": "One humid afternoon a visitor did arrive to disturb Rottcodd as he lay deeply hammocked, for his siesta was broken sharply by a rattling of the door handle […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "99fc2223-1979-4073-832b-32c3cecf3b50",
                                "sense_id": "b9f253e2-d157-3c41-95f8-ca6783db433c",
                                "text": "When it's time for siesta, you can watch them go by / Beautiful faces, no cares in this world"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e946f162-9d5e-30e7-a1f4-f47e46e98c2f",
                        "entry_id": "e65683ca-b200-3cee-a507-fa4dea41bf04",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Laid-back attitudes to work or laziness, especially by a Hispanic person."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "attributive",
                            "offensive",
                            "sometimes"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f460569-fb32-49c2-b82d-7b0525771194",
                                "sense_id": "e946f162-9d5e-30e7-a1f4-f47e46e98c2f",
                                "text": "Lest we think all of this is due to the proverbial inefficiency of the Latin American - 'siesta people' - we can see some of these signs, perhaps in a less dramatic way, in European societies and in the celebrated 'tigers' of South East Asia."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33123c86-7115-4076-9b0b-361c27b91c30",
                                "sense_id": "e946f162-9d5e-30e7-a1f4-f47e46e98c2f",
                                "text": "I had eaten a simple lunch, and in the relaxed siesta attitude that pervaded the place I settled back in my chair and looked at the mountains behind in all their austerity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9adeeae2-e970-4439-a3a9-0c86b8ec8db2",
                                "sense_id": "e946f162-9d5e-30e7-a1f4-f47e46e98c2f",
                                "text": "Many observers believe the subtropical environment contributes to a slow-paced, siesta culture in which nothing work-related is so important that it cannot wait until tomorrow."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "285f5292-69c9-44fe-a833-f46be7d30ca7",
                        "source_entry_id": "e65683ca-b200-3cee-a507-fa4dea41bf04",
                        "source_sense_description": "an afternoon nap",
                        "target_lang_word": "sieste",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sieste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f29b4f0-f4cd-3eed-8ad5-23c2260175c6",
                                        "entry_id": "43fec1dc-8b32-3b6f-b406-97825d84ebce",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sommeil auquel on se livre après le déjeuner, pendant la chaleur du jour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b61e7fd-c486-4e86-87e4-383b84d6347e",
                                                "sense_id": "2f29b4f0-f4cd-3eed-8ad5-23c2260175c6",
                                                "text": "En attendant la nourriture, nous allâmes faire la sieste ; c’est une habitude qu’il faut prendre absolument en Espagne, car la chaleur, de deux heures à cinq heures, est quelque chose dont un Parisien ne peut pas se faire une idée."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05eb0ec6-8d20-47e5-bbc2-5bcf433991ce",
                                                "sense_id": "2f29b4f0-f4cd-3eed-8ad5-23c2260175c6",
                                                "text": "Les quelques verres de Laffitte, que j’avais bus à petits coups, avaient eu l’effet de m’assoupir, et je sentis l’envie de faire une sieste de quinze ou vingt minutes, comme c’est ma coutume après le dîner."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "116328e6-356f-4420-ac7d-db984af4e74e",
                                                "sense_id": "2f29b4f0-f4cd-3eed-8ad5-23c2260175c6",
                                                "text": "En Provence, le soleil se lève deux fois. Le matin, comme partout ailleurs. Et après la sieste. Nous ne le fréquentons que dans ses moments de grâce. Nous l’abandonnons quand il fait la roue pour étonner les Parisiens. Mais il nous réserve ce qu’il a de meilleur : ses premières heures et ses derniers moments."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d41bc08c-1ca2-4f45-8855-155de9913f54",
                                                "sense_id": "2f29b4f0-f4cd-3eed-8ad5-23c2260175c6",
                                                "text": "Autre possibilité, on estime que nous avons un comptant de sommeil correct et on se lève. Dans ce cas on opte pour une sieste après manger."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60b352af-489b-4ecd-ac25-f515ff47589c",
                                                "sense_id": "2f29b4f0-f4cd-3eed-8ad5-23c2260175c6",
                                                "text": "Ma sieste a été interrompue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8564a8f0-3149-41e0-8732-5ca4937db6d1",
                                                "sense_id": "2f29b4f0-f4cd-3eed-8ad5-23c2260175c6",
                                                "text": "Vous avez fait une longue sieste."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
